        <h1>I walk the property, because photos are a speech.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Scouting is the work I most want you to hire. I go to the lot, or a trusted local contact goes when the region is not one I should pretend to cover, and you get a record of what is there. Not a mood. A record.</p>
